 282:Core/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_msp.c **** /**
 283:Core/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_msp.c ****   * @brief I2C MSP De-Initialization
 284:Core/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_msp.c ****   * This function freeze the hardware resources used in this example
